  "totalBlocks": 29,
  "translatedBlocks": 29,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "74fd4827d81912d7",
      "translationZh": "我们很高兴地宣布，Groq 现已成为 Hugging Face Hub 支持的推理服务提供商！Groq 加入了我们不断壮大的生态系统，让用户可以直接在 Hub 的模型页面上使用覆盖范围更广、能力更强的无服务器推理服务。推理服务提供商也已无缝集成到我们的客户端 SDK（支持 JS 和 Python）中，让你能够轻松通过自己偏好的服务提供商使用各种模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0345e13953b0ce9f",
      "translationZh": "Groq 支持多种文本和对话模型，包括最新的开源模型，例如 Meta 的 Llama 4、Qwen 的 QWQ-32B，以及更多其他模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bf4a4783b91330d9",
      "translationZh": "Groq 技术的核心是语言处理单元（LPU™），这是一种新型端到端处理单元系统，可为大型语言模型（LLMs）等包含顺序计算部分的计算密集型应用提供最快的推理。LPU 旨在克服 GPU 在推理方面的局限，提供显著更低的延迟和更高的吞吐量。这使其成为实时 AI 应用的理想选择。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "77d20f246bccc357",
      "translationZh": "Groq 为公开可用的模型提供快速 AI 推理服务。他们提供的 API 让开发者能够轻松将这些模型集成到自己的应用中。该服务采用按需使用、按量付费的模式，让用户能够访问各种公开可用的 LLM。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "608a8392319983de",
      "translationZh": "你现在可以在 Huggingface 上将 Groq 的 Inference API 用作推理服务提供商。我们非常期待看到你利用这个新的服务提供商构建出怎样的应用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d814df1dee1093f7",
      "translationZh": "有关如何将 Groq 用作推理服务提供商的更多信息，请阅读其专属文档页面。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e5fdfb9af6715394",
      "translationZh": "在此查看受支持的模型列表。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9c870aa6e5e93270",
      "translationZh": "工作原理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "81081802da8646bb",
      "translationZh": "在网站界面中",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "71d763e2913402e9",
      "translationZh": "在用户账户设置中，你可以：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "acf7bfc5b45f5bdb",
      "translationZh": "为你已注册的提供商设置自己的 API 密钥。如果未设置自定义密钥，你的请求将通过 HF 路由。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d74cb8ea19d4fc72",
      "translationZh": "按偏好对提供商排序。这一排序适用于模型页面中的小组件和代码片段。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "10dba80cb700cfe7",
      "translationZh": "如前所述，调用 Inference Providers 时有两种模式：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "70ad596a5abeea36",
      "translationZh": "自定义密钥（使用你自己的相应推理提供商的 API 密钥，直接向该推理提供商发起调用）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "43848c3df5d9232d",
      "translationZh": "由 HF 路由（在这种情况下，你不需要提供商的令牌，费用会直接计入你的 HF 账户，而不是你在提供商处的账户）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d7ae8780922d4fe1",
      "translationZh": "模型页面会展示第三方推理提供商（与当前模型兼容的提供商，按用户偏好排序）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "be0d888d38854a72",
      "translationZh": "通过客户端 SDK",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "fbb48338870abf08",
      "translationZh": "在 Python 中使用 huggingface_hub",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d03c532468e30082",
      "translationZh": "以下示例展示了如何以 Groq 为推理提供商来使用 Meta 的 Llama 4。你可以使用 Hugging Face 令牌，经由 Hugging Face 自动路由请求；如果你有自己的 Groq API 密钥，也可以使用它。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "555c07c97a23475c",
      "translationZh": "从源码安装 huggingface_hub（参见说明）。即将发布的 v0.33.0 版本将提供正式支持。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "11a638239fb39f43",
      "translationZh": "在 JS 中使用 @huggingface/inference",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3ac8bbca9a74cfbd",
      "translationZh": "计费",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9dd794bdf3bccdda",
      "translationZh": "对于直接请求，即使用推理提供商密钥的请求，由相应的提供商向你计费。例如，如果你使用 Groq API 密钥，费用将计入你的 Groq 账户。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "24c608a8c744f549",
      "translationZh": "对于路由请求，即通过 Hugging Face Hub 进行身份验证的请求，你只需支付提供商的标准 API 费率。我们不收取任何额外加价，只是直接转收提供商的费用。（未来，我们可能会与提供商合作伙伴达成收入分成协议。）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "267e8c36449a9380",
      "translationZh": "重要提示 ‼️ PRO 用户每月可获得价值 $2 的推理额度。您可以在不同提供商之间使用这些额度。🔥",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9e2ea1d08ca3f42b",
      "translationZh": "订阅 Hugging Face PRO 套餐，即可获得推理额度、ZeroGPU、Spaces Dev Mode、20 倍的使用限额等权益。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f78dc149c1ec0490",
      "translationZh": "我们也为已登录的免费用户提供少量免费推理额度，但如果条件允许，还请升级到 PRO！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c625dbaf508de2f3",
      "translationZh": "反馈与后续步骤",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bf060e0cea2edb62",
      "translationZh": "我们非常期待收到您的反馈！请在此分享您的想法和/或评论：https://huggingface.co/spaces/huggingface/HuggingDiscussions/discussions/49",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
